CALL newPutForth(757, 1, 'Clean air, clean water, healthy land — those are legitimate government priorities and I\'ll defend that without apology. The debate isn\'t whether to protect the environment. It\'s whether the regulatory tools we\'re using are actually effective or just costly theater.');
